{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Football</strong> blends high-speed driving with the precision of competitive football. Time your hits, control the ball, and send it rocketing into the net. Every match is a showcase of reflexes, positioning, and smart plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI in <strong>1v1, 2v2, and 3v3</strong>\u00a0game modes. Read the bounce, outmaneuver defenders, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Master 20+ Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and master <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong>, each with distinct handling and visuals. Find the ride that fits your style and refine your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Driven Ball Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bounce, deflection, and pinch is physics-based. Master plays, taps, and crucial saves to turn close matches into highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill-based, physics-driven football on wheels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1v1, 2v2, 3v3</strong> vs adaptive AI</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong> with distinct handling and looks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 unique stadiums</strong> with varied atmospheres</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast matches designed for instant action and replayability</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Amaterasu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832870/60e51d8ca00284065e134e1e09f9e5b788e96ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Aura","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832870/d05b29f4e0f45f75f9f091e037a7d86a3fcc161d.jpg"},{"name":"Bacchus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832870/f9c784938